        "content": "<div style='font-size:12px;line-height:20px'><b>NVIS</b> &nbsp;<a href='/d/nvis-home/'>Home &amp; alerts</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a href='/d/nvis-l2-executive/'>Executive area home</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a href='/d/nvis-executive/'>Executive \u2014 estate &amp; availability</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a href='/d/nvis-business-insights/'>Utilisation, power &amp; energy</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a href='/d/iren_mkz-cluster-overview/'>Estate completeness</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a href='/d/gpu-health/'>GPU health</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a href='/d/nvis-nodes-detail/'>Tray roster</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a href='/d/nvis-node-deep-dive/'>Node deep-dive</a><br><span style='color:#8E8E8E'><b>This board owns:</b> trays and GPUs present against the rack nameplate \u2014 18 trays and 72 GPUs per GB300_72x1 rack. Every rack in this estate is that type. &nbsp;\u2014&nbsp; Availability over time is on Executive; per-tray silence is on Tray roster; GPU faults are on GPU health.</span></div>",
        "mode": "html"
